# The image build needs only the files that define the build environments; the
# sources are bind-mounted at run time, never sent as build context. Beyond
# requirements.txt and platformio.ini, the source-built environment's warmup
# compiles a scratch project against the real build inputs - the IDF project
# files, the pinned sdkconfig and partition table, and the extra_scripts - so
# those travel too.
*
!requirements.txt
!platformio.ini
!CMakeLists.txt
!sdkconfig.defaults
!default_8MB.csv
!VERSION
!scripts
!src/CMakeLists.txt
